                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='36671' id='29' type-v2='text' w='12679' x='86607' y='15215'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'>- Market Concentration Risk:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'> 80% of global layoffs originated from just </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'>13</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'> market leaders. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'>- Capital as Retention Lever:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'> Negative correlation between funding and layoff intensity. To stabilize a firm&apos;s talent, keep a </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'>$200M+ capital runway</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'>- Sector Pivot:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'> Consumer and Retail sectors exhibit the highest volatility. These firms should optimize for </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Songti SC' fontsize='8'>leaner operational models.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
